%N A091019 Denominators of the coefficients in the expansion of arccosh(x)/sqrt(2*(x-1)) about x=1.
%C A091019 Numerators are A055786.
%H A091019 Q. Wei and R. Onofrio, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physleta.2010.03.035">Edge effects in electrostatic calibrations for the measurement of the Casimir force</a>, Phys. Lett. A 374 (2010) 2230-2234.
%H A091019 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/InverseHyperbolicCosine.html">Inverse Hyperbolic Cosine</a>.
%e A091019 arccosh(x)/sqrt(2*(x-1)) = 1 - (x-1)/12 + 3*(x-1)^2/160 - 5*(x-1)^3/896 + 35*(x-1)^4/18432 - 63*(x-1)^5/90112 + ... - _Eric W. Weisstein_, Oct 08 2026
%t A091019 Table[Denominator[Pochhammer[1/2, n]/(2^n (2 n + 1) n!)], {n, 0, 19}] (* _Eric W. Weisstein_, Oct 08 2026 *)
%t A091019 (* Alternative: *)
%t A091019 With[{n = Range[0, 19]}, Denominator[Pochhammer[1/2, n]/(2^n (2 n + 1) n!)]] (* _Eric W. Weisstein_, Oct 08 2026 *)
